// divide (/): unit cost of a line item.
// ignore=sqlite  the division comes out 0.232812 here and 0.232813 on the other seven -- a real difference of 4e-6, which the previous 1e-5 tolerance hid
// ignore=snowflake  same as the sqlite case: the division comes out 0.232812 here, 0.232813 on the other six -- the two form one camp against the rest, so it is the engines that differ, not one outlier
FIND order_details od
FETCH od.unit_price / od.quantity unit_cost
